{"kin ksepe": [{"id": "kiM kzepe", "headword": "किं क्षेपे", "headword_slp1": "kiM kzepe", "fold": "kin ksepe", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word किम् 'what', when implying 'contempt' is compounded with a word ending in case-affix and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किं क्षेपे २.१.६४", "२.१.६४", "२.१.६४ किं क्षेपे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiM kzepe २.१.६४", "२.१.६४", "२.१.६४ kiM kzepe"]}], "kinvfte lipsayam": [{"id": "kiMvftte lipsAyAm", "headword": "किंवृत्ते लिप्सायाम्", "headword_slp1": "kiMvftte lipsAyAm", "fold": "kinvfte lipsayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When the word किम् or its derivatives are in construction with a verb, the affix लट् (Present Tense) is used optionally after a root, in denoting future time, provided that the sentences expresses a desire of gaining on the part of the speaker.\n\nTerms: उणादि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किंवृत्ते लिप्सायाम् ३.३.६", "३.३.६", "३.३.६ किंवृत्ते लिप्सायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiMvftte lipsAyAm ३.३.६", "३.३.६", "३.३.६ kiMvftte lipsAyAm"]}], "kinvfte liNlfwO": [{"id": "kiMvftte liNlfwO", "headword": "किंवृत्ते लिङ्लृटौ", "headword_slp1": "kiMvftte liNlfwO", "fold": "kinvfte liNlfwO", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes लिङ् (Benedictive) and लृट् (I Future) come after a verb when the interrogative words like किम् etc. aer in composition with it and censure is implied.\n\nTerms: लिङ् and लृट्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किंवृत्ते लिङ्लृटौ ३.३.१४४", "३.३.१४४", "३.३.१४४ किंवृत्ते लिङ्लृटौ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiMvftte liNlfwO ३.३.१४४", "३.३.१४४", "३.३.१४४ kiMvftte liNlfwO"]}], "kinkilastyarTesu lfw": [{"id": "kiMkilAstyarTezu lfw", "headword": "किंकिलास्त्यर्थेषु लृट्", "headword_slp1": "kiMkilAstyarTezu lfw", "fold": "kinkilastyarTesu lfw", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix लृट् (I Future) is used after a root when the words किंकिल or those having the sense of अस्ति 'he is' are in construction with it (when the action is not likely to occur, or is not to be tolerated).\n\nTerms: लृट्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किंकिलास्त्यर्थेषु लृट् ३.३.१४६", "३.३.१४६", "३.३.१४६ किंकिलास्त्यर्थेषु लृट्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiMkilAstyarTezu lfw ३.३.१४६", "३.३.१४६", "३.३.१४६ kiMkilAstyarTezu lfw"]}], "kinsarvanamabahuByodvyadiByaH": [{"id": "kiMsarvanAmabahuByo'dvyAdiByaH", "headword": "किंसर्वनामबहुभ्योऽद्व्यादिभ्यः", "headword_slp1": "kiMsarvanAmabahuByo'dvyAdiByaH", "fold": "kinsarvanamabahuByodvyadiByaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "These प्राग्दिशीय affixes come after the word किम् and after a stem called सर्वनाम and after बहु but not after द्वि etc.\n\nTerms: प्राग्दिशीय - किम्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किंसर्वनामबहुभ्योऽद्व्यादिभ्यः ५.३.२", "५.३.२", "५.३.२ किंसर्वनामबहुभ्योऽद्व्यादिभ्यः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiMsarvanAmabahuByo'dvyAdiByaH ५.३.२", "५.३.२", "५.३.२ kiMsarvanAmabahuByo'dvyAdiByaH"]}], "kinyatado nirdDaraRe dvayorekasya qatarac": [{"id": "kiMyattado nirdDAraRe dvayorekasya qatarac", "headword": "किंयत्तदो निर्द्धारणे द्वयोरेकस्य डतरच्", "headword_slp1": "kiMyattado nirdDAraRe dvayorekasya qatarac", "fold": "kinyatado nirdDaraRe dvayorekasya qatarac", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the words किम् , यद् and तद् in determining of the one out of two, comes the affix डतरच् (अतर with the elision of the final इम् and अद्).\n\nTerms: डतरच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किंयत्तदो निर्द्धारणे द्वयोरेकस्य डतरच् ५.३.९२", "५.३.९२", "५.३.९२ किंयत्तदो निर्द्धारणे द्वयोरेकस्य डतरच्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiMyattado nirdDAraRe dvayorekasya qatarac ५.३.९२", "५.३.९२", "५.३.९२ kiMyattado nirdDAraRe dvayorekasya qatarac"]}], "kin kriyaprasnenupasargamapratisidDam‌": [{"id": "kiM kriyApraSne'nupasargamapratizidDam‌", "headword": "किं क्रियाप्रश्नेऽनुपसर्गमप्रतिषिद्धम्‌", "headword_slp1": "kiM kriyApraSne'nupasargamapratizidDam‌", "fold": "kin kriyaprasnenupasargamapratisidDam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The finite verb optionally retains its accent in connection with किम् when with this is asked a question relating to an action and when the verb is not preceded by a preposition or a negation.\n\nTerms: Accent", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["किं क्रियाप्रश्नेऽनुपसर्गमप्रतिषिद्धम्‌ ८.१.४४", "८.१.४४", "८.१.४४ किं क्रियाप्रश्नेऽनुपसर्गमप्रतिषिद्धम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kiM kriyApraSne'nupasargamapratizidDam‌ ८.१.४४", "८.१.४४", "८.१.४४ kiM kriyApraSne'nupasargamapratizidDam‌"]}]}